  "notes": [
    "PLUMBING SMOKE, and nothing more. A DO sag is a TRAVEL-TIME answer - it needs k1 times travel time of order one to exist at all - and 600 s over half a kilometre is four orders short of that. This run's sag numbers are NOT a physics answer and must not be read as one; what it proves is that geocode -> flowline -> section -> mesh -> WAQTEL run -> solve -> products still runs end to end. The physics lives in the refined declaration (4 km / 48 h)."
